OL,3,GNEWSAPiddington to bring legal
OL,4,Achallenge over asylum base plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government will face a legal
OL,7,Fchallenge over plans to house more than
OL,8,F1,200 asylum seekers at a former
OL,9,Fmilitary site near Piddington, the
OL,10,Fparish council chairman has said.
OL,12,FPlanning permission for the development
OL,13,Fat the MoD Bicester site near the
OL,14,FOxfordshire village was approved by the
OL,15,FHousing Secretary Angela Rayner after
OL,16,Fthe Home Office used a fast-track route
OL,17,Ffor projects deemed to be urgently
OL,18,Fneeded and of national importance.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
